    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--1\"><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><strong>火童Magmin</strong></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:left;MARGIN:0pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">滿臉惡意咧嘴譏笑的火童是包裹着黑色外殼的熔岩形成的矮胖類人形體。即使沒在燃燒，其身軀依然散發着篝火一樣的熱量，其外皮的間隙還零星的迸發出微弱的小型火苗。</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:left;MARGIN:0pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong>應召縱火者Summoned Pyromaniacs。</strong></em>火童是火元素精魄以魔法約束成的物理形態，是隻有被召喚時纔會出現在物質位面的生物。它們將所有可燃物件都看作大火災的引子，只是其召喚者的魔法控制着它們以免將所有觸及之物都焚燒殆盡。它們親近火焰與破壞的傾向使其成爲傳播混亂和毀滅的理想主體。在一座城堡召喚出一羣火童後，只需幾分鐘時間就可以將其迅速變爲一堆燃燒着的空殼。</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:left;MARGIN:0pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong>烈焰焚燬Fiery Destruction。</strong></em>儘管火童內裏的火焰非常猛烈，但其堅硬的岩漿外殼可以防止它立即點燃觸及的東西。然而，火童本身就像其內部火焰一樣反覆無常而難以預測。此外，作爲簡單的元素造物，它們也無法理解自己身爲原生元素給物質位面生物所造成的傷害。<br />火童會在爲其主人提供服務時伺機前往一些極熱的區域，比如森林火災或活火山爆發的岩漿地。此外的其他時候，它們也會從指尖上釋放出火苗來點燃其他物件，並以此自娛自樂。</p><p>A grinning, mischievous magmin resembles a stumpy humanoid sculpted from a black shell of magma. Even when it isn't ablaze and radiating heat like a bonfire, small jets of flame erupt from its porous skin.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Summoned Pyromaniacs\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Summoned Pyromaniacs.</span> Magmins are fire elemental spirits bound into physical forms by magic, and they appear in the Material Plane only when summoned. They view flammable objects as kindling for a grand conflagration, and only the magical control exerted by their summoners keeps them from setting everything they touch ablaze. Their propensity for fire and havoc makes them ideal for spreading chaos and destruction. A mob of magmins summoned inside a castle can reduce it to a burning shell within minutes.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Fiery Destruction\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Fiery Destruction.</span> Although its flame is potent, the magmin's hard magma shell prevents it from instantly igniting everything it comes into contact with. However, like the fires inside them, magmins are capricious and unpredictable. Moreover, as simple elemental creations, they are oblivious to the harm their native element causes creatures of the Material Plane.</p><p>If it has the opportunity while in service to its master, a magmin seeks out areas of great heat, such as forest fires or the bubbling magma of an active volcano. At other times, a magmin compulsively looses fire from its fingertips, delighting in setting objects ablaze.</p></div></div></div></div>",
        "public": ""
      },
