    {
      "_id": "jyFFYHEWt5zXP3ko",
      "name": "自爆 Death Burst",
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "source": {
          "custom": "",
          "book": "MM'14",
          "page": "212",
          "license": "",
          "rules": "2014",
          "revision": 1
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p>火童死亡時，它的屍體會爆炸成一股熔岩之火，其周圍10尺範圍內的每個生物必須進行一次DC 11的敏捷豁免，豁免失敗者將受到7（2d6）點火焰傷害，豁免成功則傷害減半。區域內未被着裝或攜帶的可燃物件也會隨之被點燃。</p><p>When the magmin dies, it explodes in a burst of fire and magma. Each creature within 10 feet of it must make a [[/save ability=dex dc=11]] saving throw, taking 7 ([[/damage 2d6 type=fire]]) damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. Flammable objects that aren't being worn or carried in that area are ignited.</p></div>",
          "chat": ""
        },
