        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p>作爲一個附贈動作項，火童可以點燃或熄滅自己身上的火焰。點燃時火童將散發出10尺半徑範圍的明亮光照以及其外10尺的微光光照。</p><p>As a bonus action, the magmin can set itself ablaze or extinguish its flames. While ablaze, the magmin sheds bright light in a 10-foot radius and dim light for an additional 10 feet.</p></div>",
